  "label": "woman is mapped as 'how to keep the thefts out'",
  "description": "The text 'how to keep the thefts out' is overlaid on the image of the woman interacting with the security system. This creates an analogical mapping where the woman, as the agent performing the action of securing her home, is implicitly mapped onto the concept of 'how to keep the thefts out'. The visual material (woman using security system) is mapped onto the textual material (how to keep the thefts out) via juxtaposition, suggesting she is the embodiment or personification of the solution described in the text. This mapping is central to the meme's ironic or sarcastic tone, implying that the woman's action is the method for preventing theft.",
